      "start_seconds": 262.24,
      "end_seconds": 273.44,
      "duration_seconds": 11.2,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like haemorrhoids, but I'd like to confirm. I'd like to arrange a blood count for rectal bleeding."
