      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.76,
      "end_seconds": 301.06,
      "duration_seconds": 23.3,
      "text": "We'll begin with a haemorrhoid cream, 1 application, twice a day, one week. That's for haemorrhoids. Eat more fibre and drink water. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently. Come back in four weeks. Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
